# Database

See also: `docs/005_DATABASE_SCHEMA.md`, `docs/014_SUPABASE.md`

## Source of truth

- Canonical SQL outline: `database/schema.sql`
- Versioned applies: `supabase/migrations/`

## Conventions

- UUID primary keys
- `TIMESTAMPTZ` for timestamps
- Status fields as documented unions/enums
- Index unique business keys (`sku`, `slug`, `order_number`, tracking numbers)
- Extend schema through migrations — do not edit applied migrations in place

## Core entities

`profiles` · `brands` · `categories` · `products` · `rfqs` · `quotes` · `orders`  
Phase 2+: warehouses, inventory, shipments, customs docs, CRM, invoices, embeddings, audit_logs

## RLS

- Enable RLS on user/tenant tables
- Buyer owns RFQs/orders; suppliers see invited RFQs + own quotes
- Staff roles scoped by role matrix in `docs/008_PERMISSION.md`
- Service role only in Edge Functions / privileged jobs
